ies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0803":{"code":"F-0803","title":"Ensure menus must meet the nutritional needs of residents, be prepared in advance, be followed, be updated, be reviewed by dietician, and meet the needs of the resident.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0567":{"code":"F-0567","title":"Honor the resident's right to manage his or her financial affairs.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0568":{"code":"F-0568","title":"Properly hold, secure, and manage each resident's personal money which is deposited with the nursing home.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0583":{"code":"F-0583","title":"Keep residents' personal and medical records private and confidential.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0690":{"code":"F-0690","title":"Provide appropriate care for residents who are continent or incontinent of bowel/bladder, appropriate catheter care,  and appropriate care  to prevent urinary tract infections.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-e0039":{"code":"E-0039","title":"Conduct testing and exercise requirements.","category":"Emergency Preparedness Deficiencies","concept":"emergency_preparedness","concept_label":"Emergency preparedness"},"cms-k0291":{"code":"K-0291","title":"Install emergency lighting that can last at least 1 1/2 hours.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0354":{"code":"K-0354","title":"Follow proper procedures when the automatic sprinkler systems was out 